          "sectionId": 39919
        }
      ],
      "title": "逆转的秘策·Ⅱ"
    },
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "sourceId": "39920001",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "旁白",
          "text": "自从上次不欢而散后，渚和杏之间的气氛变得很微妙——",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "39920002",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "古河渚",
          "text": "牡丹，这颗小球给你，要好好接住哟。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "39920003",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "牡丹",
          "text": "噗——",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "39920004",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "藤林杏",
          "text": "牡丹，过来这边。我没说过你可以离开吧？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "39920005",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "藤林杏",
          "text": "还有，不要随便拿别人的东西，经过我的同意了吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "39920006",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "牡丹",
          "text": "噗……噗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "39920007",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "牡丹",
          "text": "噗噗……噗……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "39920008",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "藤林杏",
          "text": "牡丹，你听不听我的话？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "39920009",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "古河渚",
          "text": "小杏，这不是牡丹的错，不要责怪它。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "39920010",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "古河渚",
          "text": "我想在消失之前……给大家送一些礼物。对了，也有小杏的。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "39920011",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "藤林杏",
          "text": "……谁稀罕你的礼物，我才不要。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "39920012",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "诶……渚和杏这是吵架了吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "39920013",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "旁白",
          "text": "闷闷不乐的杏来到主人的房间。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "39920014",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "藤林杏",
          "text": "我……我刚才一定很凶……渚她一定很难过吧？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "39920015",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "藤林杏",
          "text": "可是……可是我的心真的好痛……真的好痛……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "39920016",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "牡丹",
          "text": "噗……噗……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "39920017",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "小杏的心事我都知道，你不需要自己一个人面对。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "39920018",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "藤林杏",
          "text": "有没有什么办法，阻止渚的消失……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "39920019",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "藤林杏",
          "text": "无论是什么我都愿意去尝试……只要能让渚留下来……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "39920020",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "你还有我们大家，我们一起帮你想办法，好吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "39920021",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "藤林杏",
          "text": "如果能努力的话，就一起努力到最后……一起寻找挽回渚的办法吧。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        }
      ],
      "id": "detail-984",
      "sourceRefs": [
        {
          "bundle": "clannad",
          "rowIds": [
            39920001,
            39920002,
            39920003,
            39920004,
            39920005,
            39920006,
